@startuml system-component
title Quiz Buzzer (課堂搶答系統) - System Components (001 import + 002 live activity)

skinparam componentStyle uml2
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft JhengHei"

actor Teacher
actor "Student" as Student

node "Browser" {
  [Teacher UI\nstatic/teacher.html + teacher.js\n(passcode unlock, import,\nopen / end / cancel, live dashboard)] as TUI
  [Student UI\nstatic/student.html + student.js\n(join, wait, answer,\nown-group view, closed)] as SUI
}

node "Local server (single process: quizbuzzer.main)" {
  component "API server" as API {
    [api/auth_routes.py\nPOST /api/teacher/session] as AR
    [api/teacher_routes.py\n/api/teacher/*] as TR
    [api/student_routes.py\n/api/student/*] as SR
    [api/ws_routes.py\n/ws/teacher, /ws/student] as WSR
    [Teacher guard\napi/auth.py: require_teacher\n(TeacherSessions)] as AUTH
  }
  [Real-time channel\nrealtime/hub.py: RealtimeHub\n(teacher sockets; student sockets\nkeyed by StudentKey or None)] as RT
  [Activity service\nservices/activity_service.py:\nActivityService\n(import, open, end,\ncancel DRAFT, dashboard)] as ACT
  [Participation service\nservices/participation_service.py:\nParticipationService\n(join, leave, submit, group state)] as PART
  [Visibility filter\nservices/visibility.py:\nstudent_view(phase, group, ...)] as VIS
  [Guided Notes parser\nservices/guided_notes_parser.py:\nparse(grid, merges)] as PARSER
  component "Sheets adapter" as SA {
    interface "SheetsAdapter" as SAI
    [GoogleSheetsAdapter\nservices/google_sheets_adapter.py] as GSAD
  }
  [URL parsing\nservices/sheets_url.py:\nparse_spreadsheet_url] as URL
  database "SQLite store\ndb.py + quizbuzzer.db" as DB
}

cloud "Google" {
  [Google Sheets API] as GSA
}

Teacher --> TUI
Student --> SUI

TUI --> TR : HTTP /api/teacher/*\n(teacher session cookie)
SUI --> SR : HTTP /api/student/*\n(participant cookie)
TUI <..> WSR : WebSocket /ws/teacher
SUI <..> WSR : WebSocket /ws/student

TUI --> AR : passcode (unlock)
AR --> AUTH : TeacherSessions.create(passcode)
TR --> AUTH : every route\n(router dependency)
WSR --> AUTH : /ws/teacher upgrade
TR --> ACT : teacher commands and queries
SR --> PART : join, leave, submit, state
WSR --> ACT : state on connect (teacher)
WSR --> PART : state on connect (student)
WSR --> RT : register socket\n(teacher, or student + StudentKey)

ACT --> SAI : list_tabs(spreadsheet_id) /\nread_tab(spreadsheet_id, sheet_id)
ACT --> PARSER : parse(grid, merges)
ACT --> URL : parse_spreadsheet_url(url)
ACT --> DB : atomic transactions\n(create, re-import, phase change,\ncancel = delete DRAFT)
PART --> DB : atomic transactions\n(join, submit + rank)
ACT --> RT : activity.state + dashboard.state\n(teacher sockets)
PART --> RT : student.state snapshots;\ndashboard.state after join / leave / submit
ACT --> PART : publish_student_states()\nafter create / re-import /\nopen / end / cancel
PART --> VIS : every student-bound\nresponse and push
GSAD ..|> SAI
GSAD --> GSA : spreadsheets.get, values.get (import)\nvalues.batchUpdate RAW (export, 003)

note right of PARSER
  Pure function: no network, no DB.
  Locates header (題號 / 作答),
  numbered rows and （k） markers.
  No hardcoded addresses (Constitution II).
end note

note bottom of ACT
  Sole authority for activity phase (IV):
  DRAFT -> OPEN -> CLOSED, forward only,
  checked and changed in one transaction.
  A DRAFT activity may instead be cancelled
  (deleted); OPEN / CLOSED never are.
end note

note bottom of PART
  Sole authority for arrival order and
  rank (I): phase check + duplicate check
  + rank + insert in one BEGIN IMMEDIATE
  transaction. Group comes only from the
  participant cookie (FR-014).
end note

note right of VIS
  Constitution III: before CLOSED a student
  gets only the phase, the unit list (when
  OPEN) and its OWN group's members and
  submissions - never other groups' data,
  never rank. Pure function: it is never
  handed other groups' rows. Every student
  message is built by ParticipationService
  through it (ActivityService delegates).
end note

note left of AUTH
  Teacher passcode (TEACHER_PASSCODE in .env,
  required at startup) -> random session token
  in an HttpOnly cookie, kept in memory until
  restart. Covers ALL teacher routes (002 open /
  end / cancel / dashboard and 001 import /
  preview / confirm / re-import) and the
  /ws/teacher upgrade.
end note

note bottom of SA
  main.py builds GoogleSheetsAdapter lazily
  (LazyGoogleSheetsAdapter) so the app starts
  without Google access; tests inject
  FakeSheetsAdapter via create_app(adapter=...).
end note

note as SUPPORT
  Supporting modules (not drawn as components):
  main.py (create_app, error envelope),
  config.py (Settings from .env, incl. TEACHER_PASSCODE),
  api/schemas.py (camelCase request/response models),
  models.py (domain + transient types; see domain-class).
end note
@enduml
